Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.67,0:00:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,According to our records,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,the Manga Club has not\Nqualified for full status for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a problem before because\Nthere were open club rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.13,0:00:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,For three whole years?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the club president. How did you not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,In any case,\Nwe're going to give this room to them instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you have any questions or concerns,\Ncome talk with us in the Student Council Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're going to lose our club room...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:18.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,403.2)}{\an7}We Need an Advisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai?! Why are there stars circling your head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She cast Fuddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No time for debuffs, we have to think!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.67,0:02:34.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cure Confusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Final Fantasy system?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:43.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right, we've got to think!\NSo, uh, w-what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.79,0:02:46.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-if we lose our room,\Nwhat do we do with our stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or our books?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll have to get the doujins\Nand figures outta here somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what do we do with all these books?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-we could donate them to the school library?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our school library doesn't have a hentai section!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the club president. How did you not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.\NIf I'd been a better president...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're only losing our room because\Nwe're no longer a club, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So if we do something to remain a club,\Nthen we might be able to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If this were a manga,\Nthis is where the plot starts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And when the going gets tough,\Ntough otaku get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:32.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll do everything we can to stay, but...\NBut if we still get kicked out, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I hope you'll still stick around, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I still want to fulfill my cosplay\Ndreams with you by my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:04:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop embarrassing yourself, Okumura!\NShe's counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:04.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now things are getting interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what Lord Ashford always\Nsays when the party's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:10.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm club president.\NI've gotta do something to save our room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:18.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,324)}{\an7}Student Council Office
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That would be correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you satisfied the conditions for full club status,\Nthen you could keep your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'd need you to write a report on your\Nclub activities for us to review your status,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,but before we can do any of that,\Nyou need to have an active advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:38.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, we just need to find a teacher\Nwho's willing to be that advisor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, and when you do,\Nhave them sign this form here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it helps,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.38,0:04:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,here's a list of clubs\Nand their current advisors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Later, I can get you some examples\Nof reports to model yours after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:05:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the help.\NI know I should've been better about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:06.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you think we had it out for the Manga Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? No, I didn't think that!\NI mean, kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're just enforcing the rules.\NWe don't have any personal vendetta against you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're here to help everyone.\NAll you need to do is ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:22.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feel free to stop in if you need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We just need a teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:31.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Advise your club?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm already busy with my other clubs, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:40.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not when I've got another baby at home now.\NWant to see a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need better work-life balance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't need to oversee our meetings\Nor go to any competitions...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but putting my name down means more\Npaperwork and meetings I gotta deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you didn't realize\Nadvising a club was a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I hear that right, Okumura-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're looking for a club advisor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,And having a hard time of it, too, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hanyuu-sensei is new,\Nso she's probably available.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hanyuu-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, you haven't met her yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:25.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She teaches Home Ec, and she's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:25.96,Q3,,0,0,0,,You won't believe this, Mayuri-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She teaches Home Ec, and she's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.08,Q3,,0,0,0,,You won't believe this, Mayuri-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, it sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:29.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't even told you what it is yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.96,0:06:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it's time for you to go off to your clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, are you Hanyuu-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmm. And you're asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-none of the other teachers are available.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might've said yes in April,\Nbut we're halfway through the semester now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:55.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and Mayuri-chan is busy enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go figure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Better luck next time, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Darn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry I couldn't be of more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, boys, either go home or find a club!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.21,0:07:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NYou look like you have something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:18.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've seen her somewhere before...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(972.8,158.4)}{\an7}Milky\N{\pos(934.4,208.8)}{\an7}Succubus
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Milky Succubus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Milky" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.67,0:07:38.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-kun, right? Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayuri-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:44.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, dipshit. How'd you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-so you ARE Mayura-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:46.29,Q5,,0,0,0,,Say that name again and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-so you ARE Mayura-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:47.38,Q5,,0,0,0,,Say that name again and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, she's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Second chance. How'd you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And be honest, or you're gonna find\Nout how sharp I keep my kitchen knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:57.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:07:59.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sensei, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:02.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Need me to tell your parents you love them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're touching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Milky bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Think you're funny, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,P-please, hear me out!\NLet me tell you about our club!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:18.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! Your club's focused on cosplay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew I recognized her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's that middle-school student I met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to see her if it weren't so ironic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Without our room,\NRirisa won't be able to keep cosplaying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:44.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So please, May- uh, Hanyuu-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all the more reason for me to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:48.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've no right to show my face to her.\NNot after I betrayed the world of cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Betrayed it how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.63,0:09:06.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:12.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's obvious! I'm a teacher now,\NI can't do that kind of cosplay anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:19.92,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(857.6,352.8)}{\an7}Home Ec Workbook
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.33,0:09:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I were still selling DVDs with\Nhalf-naked pictures of myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd lose my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, that... That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why I stopped.\NThere's no other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So... so that's why I can't possibly face her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember what I said about saying that name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:33.50,Q5,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember what I said about saying that name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love cosplaying,\Nbut I always knew I'd have to give it up someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I had my fun,\Nbut stayed focused on my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I made sure I went to a good high school\Nand college and became a public school teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you blame me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:50.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello?! Why are you mad at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I chose the coward's way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:10:00.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was all ready to formally retire,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:03.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,but when the time came,\NI ghosted everyone instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I basically abandoned all my cosplay\Nfriends and pretended I never did any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm only here because I betrayed the cosplay world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:18.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got no right to face her now.\NYou have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even that didn't convince her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll let the other club have our room, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:31.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But then we have another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure somewhere in our clubroom\Nis a copy of Mayura-sama's cosrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! You have one, here, in that building?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's too much stuff in there to take it all home,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:48.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,so we were thinking of giving stuff\Naway to anyone who wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:52.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who knows what would happen if\Nanother student got their hands on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You little freak!\NAre you blackmailing me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:56.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:11:01.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the only way we can keep our clubroom!\NI have to do this for Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.96,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,158.4)}{\an7}I found a teacher who might agree to advise us!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll hear you out, but just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:07.92,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,136.8)}{\an7}I'm bringing her to the clubroom so we can talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you won't tell a soul my cosplay name!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.96,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(652.8,86.4)}{\an7}Nice, Senpai!!\N{\pos(588.8,172.8)}{\an7}Roger that!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.96,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,309.6)}{\an7}WOW!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-right, I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa! I brought...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm Ririsa Amano, I'm a first-year,\Nand I love cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll be our new advisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you change?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I thought it might be better to let her see my cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's the pretty teacher I saw the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've grown into such an incredible otaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel? A little outdated,\Nbut still completely valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you make this yourself?\NYour hems could use some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,These details are nice.\NI can tell you love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, do you know a lot about cosplay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she'll believe that.\NBut first, she needs to recognize you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:01.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-one of my friends is into cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:09.50,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(819.2,187.2)}{\an7}Milky\N{\pos(780.8,237.6)}{\an7}Succubus
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,My amazing but embarrassing first cosrom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And they've left it out there right in the open!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,A... Amano-san, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think this belongs at school-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's my favorite cosrom of all time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's by Mayura-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.71,0:12:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,and you can tell how much she\Nloves her character, Lustalotte!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every perfect detail and pose is overflowing\Nwith the respect she has for the series.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She taught me how cosplay is a wonderful\Navenue for showing your love for something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to be on her level someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you love her that much? You love... This?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's my favorite cosplayer in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.08,0:12:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to be just like her one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:05.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei, if we want to keep cosplaying,\Nwe need to have this clubroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right! I forgot we were talking about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you came on as our advisor,\Nwe could keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that all you wanted to discuss with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I agreed to hear you out,\Nand I've done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Besides, you shouldn't bring this to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.83,0:13:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll hold onto this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:30.58,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,302.4)}{\an7}Home Ec Lab
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:38.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:40.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who was that precious cinnamon roll?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:42.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,An angel?! Did God send me an angel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I literally can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to hug her and squeeze her to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to be her Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I could hug her all I wanted\Nand that wouldn't get her out of my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, can I subscribe to her?\NI'll pay for a premium sub, Ririsa Amano!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm working full time,\NI've got a higher limit on my credit card!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:01.50,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,172.8)}{\an7}RIRISA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you still need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can cut the act. I saw everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to give up, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to do this, for Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if I come on as your advisor,\Nyou might still lose your club room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you've heard about your club history.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Their old advisor Fujimoto-sensei took them\Nto the High School Manga Championship,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:44.00,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,57.6)}{\an7}High School Manga Championship
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:42.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they apparently did really well every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why they got a clubroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,With or without an advisor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.58,0:14:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,the two of you won't be able\Nto pass the report review.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know, the old club members did mention that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll figure something out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure Ririsa can keep cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:02.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I want to make sure we\Ncan keep cosplaying together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:09.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stubborn as a mule, aren't you.\NI'm with you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I also want to see more of her cosplays!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're doing this for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine. You got me.\NI'll turn in your report for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you have to do me a big favor, Okumura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get me a copy of her cosrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can have as many as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,So now we write a report?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:42.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we definitely can't tell them\Nwe're working on sexy photo collections.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right. Sorry I can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.33,0:15:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't apologize! This isn't your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me and the other Manga Club\Nmembers created this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've just gotta think of a club\Nactivity that'll make us sound legit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're the Manga Club,\Nso we could make our own manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you draw one about Liliel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've kinda always wanted\Nto draw a Liliel fan comic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:15.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Especially a retelling of that\None scene from the main series...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:17.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I definitely want to see what you come up with!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.50,0:16:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll get to work, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hanyuu-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are things going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for coming on as our advisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:32.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.29,0:16:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't take her with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you're going to draw some manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.63,0:16:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you have any advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might be your advisor,\Nbut that doesn't mean I'll have advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this your draft?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:50.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ash/Lili SFW romance, 24 pages?\NThese were big back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll want to finish your draft fast so you\Ncan be ready to print the first week of July.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:17:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,These days, you can just email stuff to the\Nprinter and get it back right away for Comiket.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you have a lot of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's see here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, a doujinshi doesn't have to have stellar art...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think your art is cute, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, this is a bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess not everyone can transform\Ntheir love into expressive works of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're on another level, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're doing what I always wanted\Nto do through your cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyways...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:39.17,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,50.4)}{\an7}After-School Program\N{\pos(102.4,100.8)}{\an7}Seeking student volunteers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,This came in today. Want to give it a go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,They want volunteers to come\Nafterschool and read to kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:52.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You two love manga, right?\NGo read some to the kids. They'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:55.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it counts as community service.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:01.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, Ashford-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll summon every ounce of courage...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're not listening at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Were we this rowdy when we were little?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry to waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay! We just need to be more passionate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've got to put our hearts into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll try using a different voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't think we'd get volunteers that were this serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it'll be better tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though even if it is,\Nthis won't be enough for a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, class!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've got someone very\Nspecial here to read to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hi, everyone! I'm Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:10.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I watch that on TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you have a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a story about Lord Ashford, a brave knight,\Nand an angel named Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,As long as everyone is still cheering us on,\Nwe'll never give up, ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-sensei, keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure how they'd react to cosplay,\Nbut this was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,She had them hooked from\Nthe second she walked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:48.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:52.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should try cosplaying sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll lend you one of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:20:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cool, these pictures came out good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:02.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not sure if this'll work,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.71,0:20:05.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,but we'll at least be able\Nto put together a good report.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.83,0:20:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry! That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:30.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't gotten through any of the anime I recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or even watched anything from last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm getting left behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:37.96,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(512,208.8)}{\an7}Eri
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Long time no talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.13,0:20:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why're you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.63,0:20:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that girl we saw?\NShe was at Spring Cosfest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.63,0:20:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Riri... You saw her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and she was super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told her we should meet up at Summer Comiket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you going, Mayura?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You haven't worn your masterpiece yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I threw it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. You'd never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't wear it. I'm a teacher now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.83,0:21:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you want to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,God, Eri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why did I spend so much time on something\Ntoo embarrassing to talk about in public?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.08,0:21:35.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I still want to cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.17,0:21:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I can't if I want to live my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.29,0:21:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had way too much last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got to live my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:01.46,Q14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780.8,309.6)}{\an7}Manga\N{\pos(806.4,360)}{\an7}Club
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good work, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard good things about your reading sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you've got the report ready, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.79,0:22:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're not submitting this report!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:24:00.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,388.8)}{\an7}Do You Love Cosplay?
